    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a fascinating journey through Russian culture with a game that will test your knowledge and erudition! In this game you will become a participant of a unique test covering the rich cultural heritage of Russia of different epochs - from ancient traditions to modern customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each correct answer you get 1 point, but be careful: for a mistake you will also get 1 point. The game requires concentration and deep knowledge, because only the most worthy will be able to earn the highest title of connoisseur of Russian culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After passing the test you will be given a special title that will reflect your level of skill. Will you become a \u201cCourtier\u201d, \u201cHundreder\u201d, \u201cPrince\u201d or perhaps a \u201cVoivode\u201d? It all depends on your knowledge and determination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to take on the challenge and demonstrate your love for Russian culture? Then start the game right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For maximum convenience you can expand the game into full screen mode by pressing F , and to return to windowed mode - just press W .</p>",
